{"id":"96ffbdbf20811eb6","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-sigma2-formula.md","title":"Sigma 2 Formula","display":"df-sigma2-formula — Sigma_2 Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-sigma2-formula","aliases":["92-df-sigma2-formula"],"display":"df-sigma2-formula — Sigma_2 Formula","depends_on":["[[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]","[[92-df-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-sigma2-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-sigma2-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sigma2-formula — Sigma_2 Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7ce1b12990ae9469\" href=\"?note=7ce1b12990ae9469\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy\">92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (formula, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_2^G\">\\(\\Sigma_2^G\\)</span> (second existential level, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7ce1b12990ae9469\" href=\"?note=7ce1b12990ae9469\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy\">92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SigmaTwo}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{SigmaTwo}_G\\)</span> (definition-target predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sigma2\\text{-}formula} \\vdash \\mathrm{SigmaTwo}_G(\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_2^G\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sigma2\\text{-}formula} \\vdash \\mathrm{SigmaTwo}_G(\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow\\varphi\\in\\Sigma_2^G\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>按<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7ce1b12990ae9469\" href=\"?note=7ce1b12990ae9469\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy\">92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy</a>的约定，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_2^G\">\\(\\Sigma_2^G\\)</span>包含与“存在量词块+<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span>公式”逻辑等价的全部公式</li>\n<li>在标准有效句子编码下，全部真<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_2\">\\(\\Sigma_2\\)</span>句的码集具有Turing度<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf 0&#39;&#39;\">\\(\\mathbf 0&#39;&#39;\\)</span>（而不是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf 0&#39;\">\\(\\mathbf 0&#39;\\)</span>）；这里说的是句子码集而不是含任意自由变量的公式类</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_2\">\\(\\Sigma_2\\)</span>层次在算术层次中位于第二层</li>\n<li>用于分析不完全性定理的强度层次</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"7ce1b12990ae9469","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"